{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FWctD8FgLScShh9xFcNc1c","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-14-0300-precompute-logup-round0-interaction-rules\n2\t\n3\tPre-compute the logup Round 0 interaction evaluation DAG, rules, and weight-index mapping at keygen time, eliminating per-AIR `SymbolicConstraints::from()`, `SymbolicDagBuilder` construction, `SymbolicRulesGpu::new()`, rule encoding, and `d_rules` device upload in `evaluate_round0_interactions_gpu`. The keygen code already builds this identical DAG (pkey.rs:116-142) but discards everything except `buffer_size`. Keeping the full pre-computed rules and a compact weight mapping table allows the hot path to skip all DAG reconstruction and only compute challenge-dependent weights (~0.2ms per AIR instead of ~1.0ms). At APC 300 with 623 AIRs across 8 round-robin-balanced threads, this eliminates ~0.8ms of CPU overhead per AIR, yielding ~50-80ms wall-time improvement for Round 0.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f93534bb-5de3-4083-9e85-ad533ac466ab","uuid":"bdec25fd-ad81-4006-8ef4-79f6dacae816","timestamp":"2026-04-14T01:18:53.330Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-14-0300-precompute-logup-round0-interaction-rules\n\nPre-compute the logup Round 0 interaction evaluation DAG, rules, and weight-index mapping at keygen time, eliminating per-AIR `SymbolicConstraints::from()`, `SymbolicDagBuilder` construction, `SymbolicRulesGpu::new()`, rule encoding, and `d_rules` device upload in `evaluate_round0_interactions_gpu`. The keygen code already builds this identical DAG (pkey.rs:116-142) but discards everything except `buffer_size`. Keeping the full pre-computed rules and a compact weight mapping table allows the hot path to skip all DAG reconstruction and only compute challenge-dependent weights (~0.2ms per AIR instead of ~1.0ms). At APC 300 with 623 AIRs across 8 round-robin-balanced threads, this eliminates ~0.8ms of CPU overhead per AIR, yielding ~50-80ms wall-time improvement for Round 0.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
