alization (lines 229-238)\n\n3. **Logup interactions evaluation** (lines 244-279):\n   - Build interaction DAG rules from symbolic constraints (NOT pre-allocated per AIR)\n   - Check pre-allocated logup buffers (lines 247-260)\n   - Call `evaluate_round0_interactions_gpu()` (lines 262-279) — **GPU KERNEL LAUNCH #2**\n\n4. **Logup polynomial construction** (lines 281-314):\n   - **D2H copy**: `sum.to_host_on_current_stream()` (line 282) — **PER-AIR SYNC POINT**\n   - Fractional unpack (lines 283-284)\n   - Optional normalization for negative n (lines 285-289)\n   - Transpose evaluation layout (lines 291-300)\n   - TWO iDFTs: `UnivariatePoly::from_geometric_cosets_evals_idft()` x2 (lines 301-310) — **CPU iDFT #2 & #3**\n\n### **Fixed Costs Per AIR**\n\n1. **GPU work**:\n   - 2 kernel launches (zerocheck + logup)\n   - 2 D2H copies with implicit stream synchronization\n   - 1 GPU malloc for main_parts array upload\n\n2. **CPU work** (CPU thread pool):\n   - Constraint extraction from pk\n   - 3 iDFT operations (each O(domain_size * log(domain_size)))\n   - Transpose loops (3x: zerocheck, logup_numer, logup_denom)\n   - Polynomial coefficient construction\n\n### **Batched Descriptor Approach (REVERTED)** \n\n**Commit history**:\n- `0c699f47` (Apr 13): Batch Round 0 descriptor arrays infrastructure added\n  - `Round0ZcCtx` / `Round0LogupCtx` per-AIR descriptor structs\n  - `batched_zerocheck_r0_coset_parallel_kernel` & `batched_logup_r0_coset_parallel_kernel`\n  - Single 1D grid, blocks indexed via `BlockCtx` to find AIR and (coset, x_block)\n  - Infrastructure-only, not wired into pipeline\n\n- `b617e156` (Apr 13, 1 hour later): **REVERTED** with no explanation in commit message\n  - Removed ~959 lines of CUDA kernel and Rust FFI code\n  - Indicates integration or correctness issue discovered during testing\n\n**Why it likely failed**:\n1. **Heterogeneous per-AIR costs**: Batched kernels assume uniform block structure; varying AIR constraint degrees & heights break load