{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HT75t5hV6wFKK4iz3XkQf4","type":"tool_result","content":"120\t### Change 3: Pre-compute and upload Lagrange basis tables\n121\t\n122\t**File**: `crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs`, inside `sumcheck_uni_round0_polys` (before the multi-stream loop, around line 949)\n123\t\n124\t`l_skip` is fixed per proof (set in `SystemParams`), not per AIR. `omega_root` varies by AIR via `F::two_adic_generator(log2_ceil(local_constraint_deg << l_skip))`.\n125\t\n126\tBefore Phase 1 (work item construction):\n127\t1. Collect unique `local_constraint_deg` values across all AIRs.\n128\t2. For each unique `d`, compute:\n129\t   - `omega_root = F::two_adic_generator(log2_ceil_usize(d << l_skip))`\n130\t   - `coset_base = omega_root.exp_power_of_2(l_skip)` (since `log_height = l_skip`)\n131\t   - For **zerocheck** (`num_cosets = d-1`, `init = omega_root`):\n132\t     - `lagrange_basis = lagrange_basis_from_geometric_points(coset_base, d-1, omega_root.exp_power_of_2(l_skip))`\n133\t     - `shift_invs`: for each `col in 0..d-1`, `row in 0..skip_domain`: `(omega_root^{-(col+1)})^row`\n134\t   - For **logup** (`num_cosets = d`, `init = F::ONE`):\n135\t     - `lagrange_basis = lagrange_basis_from_geometric_points(coset_base, d, F::ONE.exp_power_of_2(l_skip))`\n136\t     - `shift_invs`: for each `col in 0..d`, `row in 0..skip_domain`: `(F::ONE^{-1} * omega_root^{-col})^row = omega_root^{-col*row}`\n137\t3. Flatten each Lagrange basis into `Vec<EF>` of size `width * width` (row-major), and each shift_invs table into `Vec<EF>` of size `width * skip_domain`. Upload to GPU.\n138\t4. Store in a `HashMap<usize, PrecomputedR0Tables>` keyed by `local_constraint_deg`, where `PrecomputedR0Tables` contains 4 `DeviceBuffer<EF>` fields: `{zc_lagrange, zc_shift_invs, logup_lagrange, logup_shift_invs}`.\n139\t\n140\tExpected: 2-3 unique `d` values, ~400 EF values total (~6KB GPU memory).\n141\t\n142\t### Change 4: Pre-allocate device batch polynomial array\n143\t\n144\t**File**: `crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs`, inside `sumcheck_uni_round0_polys`"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q1KfgaZz2xthmPrenpaYXs","session_id":"f93534bb-5de3-4083-9e85-ad533ac466ab","uuid":"c84bad40-5248-4580-a9be-74c42f6d3a7f","timestamp":"2026-04-14T04:30:41.298Z"}
