{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011hW2ZNEeyRPjFbvSWb9dAt","type":"tool_result","content":"=== task.md ===\n# 2026-04-14-0330-gpu-round0-poly-extraction\n\nMove the per-AIR polynomial extraction in Round 0 (D2H sync + transpose + iDFT + Lagrange interpolation + coefficient adjustment) from CPU to a small CUDA kernel that runs on the same stream immediately after each evaluation kernel. This eliminates all per-AIR `cudaStreamSynchronize` calls in the multi-stream Round 0 loop and the ~40ms of CPU post-processing per thread, replacing them with a negligible GPU-side computation that writes polynomial coefficients directly into a device-side batch array. A single D2H copy of the complete batch array replaces the current 1246 per-AIR pipeline drains.\n\n=== plan.md exists ===\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 georg georg 19373 Apr 14 06:34 /home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-14-0330-gpu-round0-poly-extraction/plan.md\n\n=== baseline exists ===\napc000.json\napc100.json\napc300.json\nnsys_apc000.nsys-rep\nnsys_apc000.sqlite\n\n=== current metrics exist ===\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 georg georg 1050639 Apr 14 03:21 /home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/current_apc000.json\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 georg georg 2092800 Apr 14 03:21 /home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/current_apc300.json\n\n=== nsys profile exists ===\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 georg georg 6533060 Apr 14 06:01 /home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/current_nsys_apc300.nsys-rep\n\n=== no source code modified ===\n autoopt-results/current_apc000.json                | 604 ++++++++++-----------\n autoopt-results/current_apc300.json                | 424 +++++++--------\n autoopt-results/log.md                             |  24 +\n autoopt-results/logs/20260413-224337-18-1-plan.log | 361 ++++++++++++\n autoopt-results/task.md                            |   4 +-\n 5 files changed, 901 insertions(+), 516 deletions(-)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f93534bb-5de3-4083-9e85-ad533